pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.5pt\">1. 신청자격 : 2010학년도 전기 일반대학원 학위수여예정자[2011. 2. 18(금)]</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2. 제출서류 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 면제 신청원 1부. </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 면제관련 증빙서류(사본) 1부.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">3. 졸업외국어시험 면제요건 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 본교 대학원 해당과정 재학 중(최근 3년이내)에 TOEIC 성적이 500점</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(TOEFL, TEPS의 점수는 토익 500점에 상응하는 점수)이상을 취득한 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 본교 대학원 해당과정 재학 중 어학교육원에서 시행하는 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #ff00ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\">중급 이상</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\">의 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">영어강좌를 40시간 이상 이수한 자</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\"> </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">4. 졸업외국어시험 면제신청 접수기간 및 장소</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 접수 기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #0000ff; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">2011. 1. 19(수) ~ 1. 21(금) [3일간]</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 접수 장소 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">각 학과 종합학사행정실</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 면제 신청원 양식 : 첨부 파일 참조</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\">5. 합격자 발표 : 2011. 1. 25.(화) 원스톱서비스</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;☞ 경로 : 원스톱서비스/로그인/학적자료조회/외국어시험(Y or N)으로 표기</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1pt\"><br><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2011. 1</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">금오공과대학교 대학원장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
